{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens after Plague Inc. wipes out the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after the Necroa Virus ravaged humanity, a few survivors emerge. Build a settlement, explore, scavenge resources and expand as you shape your post-apocalyptic society. The world is green and beautiful but danger lurks in the ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/e938e511b41dc9b2bb38556eab77aceb.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Inc: Revival is the brand new game from the creator of \u2018Plague Inc.\u2019 - one of the most popular games ever with over 190 million players. Brilliantly executed with beautiful graphics and critically acclaimed gameplay \u2013 After Inc: Revival is engaging and easy to learn. Build multiple settlements and gain abilities in a persistent campaign to lead humanity out of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public Service Announcement: Unlike our other games, I\u2019m pleased to say that After Inc: Revival is not based on any real-world situation. No need to start worrying about a real-life zombie apocalypse yet\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/8e4af272b1cdc04e4fa206f252ec4ff4.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the ruins of the past to scavenge / harvest resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Settlement with housing, farms, lumberyards and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your society and provide services to keep your people happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult decisions - Are children an unaffordable luxury? Are dogs pets or a food source? Democracy or Authoritarianism?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate zombie infestations and defend humanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/6283ceea67ee10ccb542fa7250e17243.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful post-apocalyptic United Kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build multiple settlements in a persistent campaign and level up abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-realistic modelling of Zombie behaviour based on real-life studies\u2026 :P</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophisticated narrative algorithms shaped by your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique leaders with radically different abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/86a2541a3ea870b61d2e9bcdb8f33257.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gentrification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/959fffdba2983d0f0e7316c85ae9d26cc17554f5.jpg"},{"name":"Cure Inc.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/6bc3a8c7ed11c375dc51c8e5392fe13b899fb2a7.jpg"},{"name":"Furious and Fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/830640ad12718ff545f166f721424c45f73cdea9.jpg"},{"name":"Phone Home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/ca2dd50c77e40b59da9b71068cb8e3d140a6e4f3.jpg"},{"name":"The Hatch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/a3c3fa8a71a1b550c18b05c35330a80e593135d7.jpg"},{"name":"You Shall Not Pass!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/62d3ce7020bafe975ac0497c5e4283d05566a824.jpg"},{"name":"Nudists Lament","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/41b63e8333e47fce02e8328709f7f5d6a8ffd733.jpg"},{"name":"My name is Ozymandias","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/0ba33e58f866e399c847f79930f80360a16c19c6.jpg"},{"name":"Let them eat bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/60f74a88199ede0b6813cf6ea4c0143f487a03a7.jpg"},{"name":"We Need You!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337140/d9b55466a244742739d08f809f7e7e69c02bdcba.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337140?t=1765284667","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/86d7cd24a3bbb0ec3bf5e04d6e1889e1e24f1d10/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765284667","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/ff6e02d61ecf93fa20f5283a5e65c1e03d55c1f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765284667","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/ff6e02d61ecf93fa20f5283a5e65c1e03d55c1f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765284667","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3676860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/b65bb43ca441e6fa789c77ed9aa214c9.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=1249 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens after Plague Inc. wipes out the world?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades after the Necroa Virus ravaged humanity, a few survivors emerge. Build a settlement, explore, scavenge resources and expand as you shape your post-apocalyptic society. The world is green and beautiful but danger lurks in the ruins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/e938e511b41dc9b2bb38556eab77aceb.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Inc: Revival is the brand new game from the creator of \u2018Plague Inc.\u2019 - one of the most popular games ever with over 190 million players. Brilliantly executed with beautiful graphics and critically acclaimed gameplay \u2013 After Inc: Revival is engaging and easy to learn. Build multiple settlements and gain abilities in a persistent campaign to lead humanity out of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public Service Announcement: Unlike our other games, I\u2019m pleased to say that After Inc: Revival is not based on any real-world situation. No need to start worrying about a real-life zombie apocalypse yet\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/8e4af272b1cdc04e4fa206f252ec4ff4.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit the ruins of the past to scavenge / harvest resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your Settlement with housing, farms, lumberyards and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your society and provide services to keep your people happy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make difficult decisions - Are children an unaffordable luxury? Are dogs pets or a food source? Democracy or Authoritarianism?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exterminate zombie infestations and defend humanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/6283ceea67ee10ccb542fa7250e17243.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beautiful post-apocalyptic United Kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build multiple settlements in a persistent campaign and level up abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-realistic modelling of Zombie behaviour based on real-life studies\u2026 :P</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophisticated narrative algorithms shaped by your decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique leaders with radically different abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/extras/86a2541a3ea870b61d2e9bcdb8f33257.avif?t=1765284667\" width=780 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ndemic Creations"],"dlc":[3744030],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337140/448146cbc6b40b1098d207327ce781b07be83246/header.jpg?t=1765284667","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Big Sur (11.6)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Pro graphics 6200 1536mb<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Older MacOS versions not well supported.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Big Sur (11.6)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel 655 1536 MB<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Older MacOS versions not well supported.</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337140/1342205500/30000c1aa7c883e545471ac4bd58b5a44c028ec1/1759228926/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759229628","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337140/1342205500/30000c1aa7c883e545471ac4bd58b5a44c028ec1/1759228926/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759229628","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3337140/1342205500/30000c1aa7c883e545471ac4bd58b5a44c028ec1/1759228926/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759229628","id":257209200,"name":"Shadows Of The Past","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst